## Architecture Patterns

### MVVM Implementation
```
Models/ - Entity classes with INotifyPropertyChanged
├── Note.cs - Main note entity
├── AudioRecord.cs - Multiple audio recordings per note
├── UserProfile.cs - User profile and preferences
├── Subscription.cs - Premium subscription data
├── UsageMetrics.cs - AI usage tracking

ViewModels/ - Business logic and data binding
├── BaseViewModel.cs - Common MVVM functionality
├── NoteListViewModel.cs - Note management operations  
├── NoteDetailViewModel.cs - Audio recording and editing
├── WelcomeViewModel.cs - Onboarding flow
├── UserProfileViewModel.cs - User management
├── PremiumViewModel.cs - Subscription management

Views/ - UI and user interaction
├── NoteListPage.xaml - Notes overview with delete functionality
├── NoteDetailPage.xaml - Audio recording interface
├── WelcomePage.xaml - App introduction carousel
├── UserOnboardingPage.xaml - User setup questions
├── LoginPage.xaml - Authentication
├── PremiumPage.xaml - Subscription options

Services/ - Business services and external integrations
├── NoteDatabase.cs - SQLite CRUD operations
├── IAudioRecordingService.cs - Audio capture management
├── IAudioPlaybackService.cs - Audio playback with state tracking
├── IApiService.cs - Backend API integration (ready for AI)
├── IUserService.cs - User management
├── IPremiumService.cs - Subscription management
├── IAnalyticsService.cs - Usage tracking
├── ISecurityService.cs - Biometric authentication

Helpers/ - Utility classes
├── AppResources.cs - Multilanguage string management
├── EncryptionHelper.cs - Data encryption utilities
├── StoreHelper.cs - In-app purchase utilities
```

### Database Schema
```sql
Notes:
  ID (PK), Title, Date, CreatedAt, UpdatedAt, AudioFilePath, UserID (FK)

AudioRecords:  
  ID (PK), NoteID (FK), Title, FileName, FilePath,
  Duration, FileSizeBytes, RecordedAt, HasSummary, 
  SummaryText, IsUploaded, AIProcessingHours

UserProfiles:
  ID (PK), Email, Name, AgeGroup, UsagePurpose, 
  LanguagePreference, RecordingFrequency, CreatedAt

Subscriptions:
  ID (PK), UserID (FK), Type, StartDate, EndDate, 
  Status, StoreTransactionId

UsageMetrics:
  ID (PK), UserID (FK), TotalNotes, AIProcessingHours,
  TranslationRequests, LastUsage, Month

-- Cascade delete: User deletion removes all related data
```

